  "description": "You can have everything else, but not him!\n\nWhen Anita's long-lost older sister Arabella finally turns up after 19 years, their parents are overjoyed and begin to shower her with the love and attention Anita never received. But when they try to take away her best friend and fiancé, Axion, Anita finally puts her foot down. She's had enough.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
